{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the far eastern resort land of Naruelu Kingdom comes a set featuring regional costumes and their renowned wine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also create a variety of wine-based dishes in your kitchen at home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Costumes and equipment are available at Matsuri Apparel and Kagari Accouterments on Castle St.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wine is available at Caravan Co. in Old Town Riverside.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This DLC includes the following items:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u30fbNaruelu Kingdom Outfits</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Available at Matsuri Apparel on Castle St.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sheerall Clothing, Rookes Clothing, Naruelu Kid's Wear: Blue, Naruelu Kid's Wear: Orange, Naruelu Kid's Wear: Green</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u30fbWine-colored Outfits &amp; Equipment</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Available at Matsuri Apparel on Castle St.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Town Furs: Wine, Kid's Town Furs: Wine, Fur Beret: Wine</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u30fbWine</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Available at Caravan Co. in Old Town Riverside.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Naruelu Wine, Naruelu Wine (S)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u30fbCooking Recipes</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Adds new recipes that let you cook dishes using wine at your home kitchen.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bolognese Sauce, Spaghetti Bolognese, Bolognese Pie, Fisherman's Pie, Stewed Hamburger Steak, Pom Wine Jelly, Naruelu Wine Pound Cake, Naruelu Wine Jelly, Red Dragon Fish Stewed in Wine</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u203b This content can only be purchased once per account.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u203b If you uninstall the DLC after saving, that save data will no longer be loadable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u203b The base game (sold separately) is required to use this content.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please ensure your game is updated to the latest version if necessary.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4021480?t=1762242689","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4021480?t=1762242689","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4021480/158a1662ccd30f4391e24f860f0021413ded8ebf/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762242689","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4021480/158a1662ccd30f4391e24f860f0021413ded8ebf/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762242689","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the far eastern resort land of Naruelu Kingdom comes a set featuring regional costumes and their renowned wine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also create a variety of wine-based dishes in your kitchen at home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Costumes and equipment are available at Matsuri Apparel and Kagari Accouterments on Castle St.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wine is available at Caravan Co. in Old Town Riverside.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This DLC includes the following items:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u30fbNaruelu Kingdom Outfits</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Available at Matsuri Apparel on Castle St.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sheerall Clothing, Rookes Clothing,